## 5. Third-Party API Key

`crates/beeper-core/src/cloud.rs` contains the KLIPY GIF API key of Beeper Desktop.
The key comes from the public Beeper Desktop app, and it is the property of Beeper Inc. or KLIPY.
The repository stores the key masked so that it is not plain text, but the mask does not protect it: anyone can get the key from the code.
`beeper-rs` uses the key only to search and show GIFs in the GIF picker, as Beeper Desktop does.
The owner of the key can revoke it at any time. If the owner asks, the maintainers will remove it.
